# Nested patterns use ** so host builds (Windows/macOS junction+symlink farms)
# can never clobber the container's own pnpm install via COPY . .
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.wrangler
**/coverage
.turbo
.wrangler
.mf
.deploy
.selfhost
release
reports
build
data
.playwright-mcp
.zcode
gui-test-screenshots
.tmp-*
.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars
.cf-deploy.env
.cloudflare.env
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
landing
landing/dist-ssr
landing-full-desktop.png
AUDIT-*.md
# R8 (main-line P3): git history inflates the build context and does not
# belong in any image layer.
.git
